## Goal
Make the "remember failed" macOS notification show a single banner when failures repeat, instead of stacking up in Notification Center (DEV-50).

## Problems
None.

## Decision
In `internal/handler/handler.m`, before building the new notification content, the code now calls `removeDeliveredNotificationsWithIdentifiers:` for the fixed `remember-failed` identifier. Reusing an identifier only replaces a pending request, not one that has already been delivered. Removing the delivered one first keeps the same identifier and leaves one visible banner. It is a one-line change next to the code that posts the notification.

